<title>MALAYSIA: K &amp; N Kenanga debuts at 3.82 ringgit.</title>
<headline>K &amp; N Kenanga debuts at 3.82 ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockbroking concern K &amp; N Kenanga Holdings Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange's main board on Tuesday at 3.82 ringgit, against an offer price of 2.50 ringgit.</p>
<p>At 0135 GMT, the stock was trading at 3.84 ringgit after hitting a low of 3.50.</p>
<p>The company had offered for sale 75 million shares.  </p>
<p>For the year ended December 31, 1995, K &amp; N Kenanga reported a pre-tax profit of 70.9 million ringgit on operating revenue of 80.54 million ringgit.</p>
<p>It has forecast a pre-tax profit of 91.48 million ringgit for the year ending in December 1996.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
